  "releaseNotes": "# Changes since version 8.2.1:\n\n## Fixed\n- Fixed an issue where certain PDF files became damaged after being re-saved with GcPdfDocument. (DOC-7185)\n- Fixed incorrect text spacing in PDFs that use custom character spacing (Tc) without resetting it. (DOC-7190\n- Fixed an issue where opening certain PDF files could throw an exception during parsing. (DOC-7186)",
